        {
            "heading": "About",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The Gaumont State Theatre is one of Britain’s finest surviving super cinemas and an important part of London’s entertainment and architectural heritage. Featuring the building in Open House 2026 would give visitors a rare opportunity to explore its remarkable interior, learn about its evolution from cinema to its present role as a church, and appreciate its renewed potential as a venue for live performance and community use."
            ]
